            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zakoduj metodę <code>setTimeout()</code>, aby uzupełnić kod.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"204\" endIndex=\"214\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"simulateBattle\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// battle logic\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// updates `score` variable\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" score += \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"simulateBattle();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Battle processing...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = \" /><text value=\"`Score updated to \" /><text value=\"${score}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"9000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can open your inventory while waiting.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>setTimeout</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 149764,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zakoduj opóźnienie wynoszące <code>8000</code> milisekund w metodzie <code>setTimeout()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"249\" endIndex=\"253\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"simulateBattle\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// battle logic\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// updates `score` variable\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" score += \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"simulateBattle();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Battle processing...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = \" /><text value=\"`Score updated to \" /><text value=\"${score}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"8000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can open your inventory while waiting.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>8000</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 149765,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uzupełnij kod, aby funkcja callback wykonała się tak szybko, jak to możliwe.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"113\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame start&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Deferred collision check, even with no delay&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame end&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 149766,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zakoduj funkcję wywołania zwrotnego, która wyświetla wynik <code>simulateBattle()</code>, jako pierwszy parametr <code>setTimeout()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"265\" endIndex=\"274\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"simulateBattle\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// battle logic\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// updates `score` variable\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" score += \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"simulateBattle();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Battle processing...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = \" /><text value=\"`Score updated to \" /><text value=\"${score}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(showScore, \" /><text value=\"5000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can open your inventory while waiting.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>showScore</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
